    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "681a3175f7ea0aaa",
      "translationZh": "在配备 RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (Max-Q) 的 IGX Thor 上运行 Qwen3.8-27B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b806859e9600cd82",
      "translationZh": "花了几个小时在一台 NVIDIA IGX Thor 上搭建自托管推理主机，却找不到这一硬件组合的任何性能数据，所以这里分享一下我的测试结果。所有数据都来自在这台实际机器上的运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3df07bae50351497",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA IGX Thor T7000 开发套件，aarch64，14 核 CPU，Ubuntu 24.04.4",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40afa07c15ece992",
      "translationZh": "RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Max-Q Workstation，96GB，sm_120，300W 功耗上限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a511d44490183c9",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Thor，sm_110，与主机共享 122GB 统一 LPDDR5X 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bed2572dcc7c555",
      "translationZh": "SGLang 开发构建版本 5f55db35e，torch 2.13.0+cu130",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09468f866d8beede",
      "translationZh": "Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8，27.8B 参数，混合 Gated DeltaNet 架构，262144 上下文长度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "968490c9f60e5a7c",
      "translationZh": "在看数据之前，有一点需要说明：这张卡是300W的Max-Q版本，而不是600W版本。满功率版本的表现应该会更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72501f3a445c0fc5",
      "translationZh": "五种配置下的LLM吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddf0d45615772411",
      "translationZh": "在单张GPU上使用sglang.bench_serving运行，ISL为8192，OSL为1024。通用参数为 --kv-cache-dtype fp8_e4m3 --mem-fraction-static 0.85 --attention-backend flashinfer 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "654446996c76aded",
      "translationZh": "配置 conc 1 tok/s TPOT conc 16 tok/s TPOT TTFT @16 实际并发数 KV池",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d93139debaddfc99",
      "translationZh": "DFlash2 + fp32 + 惰性基数树",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "faf8dd3c3cb86f8b",
      "translationZh": "推测解码确实物有所值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ce86a77a3f55491",
      "translationZh": "在批大小为1时，它带来了2.8倍的吞吐量：126.3 tok/s，对比44.7 tok/s，同时TPOT从21.3ms降至6.67ms。更令人惊讶的是并发数为16时的TTFT，从10530ms降至3161ms，降幅达3.3倍。在我的测试中，DFlash2在这两种情况下都胜过了EAGLE。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59d3f801ac831a38",
      "translationZh": "SSM状态的数据类型会让你吃苦头",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cbd0d08c2368742",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 是一个混合 Gated DeltaNet 模型，因此除了 KV 缓存之外，还有一个 GDN 状态池。配合 DFlash2 使用 fp32 运行这个池，会使草稿验证缓冲区膨胀到大约 25GB，随后服务器就会悄悄把并发请求数限制为 21，即使你要求的是 32。没有任何报错。它只是处理更少的请求，也不告诉你。把状态切换为 bf16 会让这个池的大小减半，恢复全部 32 个槽位，并让 KV 池的大小大致翻倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db4e4594f3b83151",
      "translationZh": "唯一能看出这一点的地方是启动日志中的 max_running_requests 那一行，所以每次更改配置后都要检查它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7447957184c3a48d",
      "translationZh": "bf16 状态没有造成任何我能测出的准确率损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce7799940f87f76e",
      "translationZh": "GSM8K，200 道题，temperature 为 0，通过聊天端点而非内置评估来评分：bf16 的准确率为 93.5%，fp32 为 94.0%。两者只差一道题，在 n=200 时完全处于噪声范围内。因此，bf16 速度更快，能容纳两倍的 KV，并达到完整的并发量，而我检测不到任何代价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6ed149de2c594b5",
      "translationZh": "值得一提的是，SGLang 自带的 run_eval gsm8k 在我这里得分为 0.0。它调用 /v1/completions，不使用聊天模板，因此推理模型的输出始终无法匹配它的答案正则表达式。如果你看到零分，先检查评估框架，再责怪模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76a4b1e54dfab3e9",
      "translationZh": "推理模式占了首个 token 延迟的大部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a72e1ace18b93294",
      "translationZh": "简短的对话提示词，流式输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56bc951cfafdc5a4",
      "translationZh": "模式 首个 token 首个内容 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
